{
  "uid": "ai-agent-traffic",
  "title": "AI Agent Traffic (beta)",
  "description": "Router switchboard and trace rate, errors, and duration from cumulative counters and histogram buckets. Beta; live histogram bucket naming needs verification.",
  "tags": [
    "ai-observability",
    "traffic",
    "beta"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "editable": true,
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Coverage and interpretation",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Beta.** The router graph uses measured total token rates over 5 minutes. A caller is an API key alias, otherwise a team, otherwise unattributed; it is not proof of agent identity. The same tokens appear on both graph hops: do not sum edges across hops. Provider labels do not distinguish subscriptions from pay-per-token billing or identify every local engine. Trace RED tables use Cribl cumulative span counters. Duration queries assume Prometheus-style llm_span_duration_seconds_bucket series with le labels; verify the live export before interpreting percentiles. No service-graph series exists. Missing data stays missing; no sample values are included."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Local vs remote token share: provider coverage",
      "description": "Measured share of total router tokens over 5 minutes. hosted_vllm identifies the known local provider. Other providers have unresolved locality (including MLX) and billing class; this is not a complete physical local/remote split. No zero fill; absent series and zero traffic remain unavailable.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "victoriametrics"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100,
          "decimals": 1,
          "noValue": "No token samples",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "legendFormat": "Known local: hosted_vllm",
          "expr": "100 * sum(rate(litellm_total_tokens_metric_total{api_provider=\"hosted_vllm\"}[5m])) / (sum(rate(litellm_total_tokens_metric_total[5m])) > 0)"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "legendFormat": "Other providers: locality unresolved",
          "expr": "100 * sum(rate(litellm_total_tokens_metric_total{api_provider!=\"hosted_vllm\"}[5m])) / (sum(rate(litellm_total_tokens_metric_total[5m])) > 0)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "nodeGraph",
      "title": "Router switchboard: caller → model → provider",
      "description": "Existing LiteLLM total-token counter only, input plus output tokens/s over 5 minutes. Key alias takes priority over team. Namespaced IDs keep callers, models, and providers distinct. Node stats are tokens/s for that entity. Both hops count the same traffic. Unknown model/provider labels remain explicit unknown nodes. Provider is the observed API provider, not a billing category or a physical backend. MLX and individual GPU engines cannot be resolved from this graph alone.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "victoriametrics"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 13
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "suffix: tok/s",
          "decimals": 1,
          "noValue": "Unavailable"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "nodes": {
          "mainStatUnit": "suffix: tok/s"
        },
        "edges": {
          "mainStatUnit": "suffix: tok/s"
        },
        "zoomMode": "cooperative"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "expr": "label_replace((label_replace(label_join(sum by (source, target) (label_replace(label_replace(label_replace(label_replace(label_replace(sum by (api_key_alias, team, model) (rate(litellm_total_tokens_metric_total[5m])), \"source\", \"caller:unattributed\", \"\", \"\"), \"source\", \"team:$1\", \"team\", \"(.+)\"), \"source\", \"key:$1\", \"api_key_alias\", \"(.+)\"), \"target\", \"model:unknown\", \"\", \"\"), \"target\", \"model:$1\", \"model\", \"(.+)\")), \"id\", \" → \", \"source\", \"target\"), \"frame\", \"edges\", \"\", \"\") or label_replace(label_join(sum by (source, target) (label_replace(label_replace(label_replace(label_replace(sum by (model, api_provider) (rate(litellm_total_tokens_metric_total[5m])), \"source\", \"model:unknown\", \"\", \"\"), \"source\", \"model:$1\", \"model\", \"(.+)\"), \"target\", \"provider:unknown\", \"\", \"\"), \"target\", \"provider:$1\", \"api_provider\", \"(.+)\")), \"id\", \" → \", \"source\", \"target\"), \"frame\", \"edges\", \"\", \"\") or label_replace(sum by (id) (label_replace(label_replace(label_replace(sum by (api_key_alias, team) (rate(litellm_total_tokens_metric_total[5m])), \"id\", \"caller:unattributed\", \"\", \"\"), \"id\", \"team:$1\", \"team\", \"(.+)\"), \"id\", \"key:$1\", \"api_key_alias\", \"(.+)\")), \"frame\", \"nodes\", \"\", \"\") or label_replace(sum by (id) (label_replace(label_replace(sum by (model) (rate(litellm_total_tokens_metric_total[5m])), \"id\", \"model:unknown\", \"\", \"\"), \"id\", \"model:$1\", \"model\", \"(.+)\")), \"frame\", \"nodes\", \"\", \"\") or label_replace(sum by (id) (label_replace(label_replace(sum by (api_provider) (rate(litellm_total_tokens_metric_total[5m])), \"id\", \"provider:unknown\", \"\", \"\"), \"id\", \"provider:$1\", \"api_provider\", \"(.+)\")), \"frame\", \"nodes\", \"\", \"\")), \"title\", \"$1\", \"id\", \"(.+)\")"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true
            },
            "indexByName": {},
            "renameByName": {
              "Value": "mainstat"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "partitionByValues",
          "options": {
            "fields": [
              "frame"
            ],
            "keepFields": false,
            "naming": {
              "asLabels": false
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "filter": {
            "id": "byRefId",
            "options": "/.*-nodes$/"
          },
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "source": true,
              "target": true
            },
            "indexByName": {},
            "renameByName": {}
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Trace RED: per service",
      "description": "Cribl cumulative span counters, rated over 5 minutes. Rate counts spans/s, not necessarily external requests. Error is llm_span_errors as a percentage of llm_span_calls. Duration quantiles aggregate classic histogram buckets by le over 5 minutes. The llm_span_duration_seconds_bucket export name is unverified in metrics mode and needs a live check. Missing errors or histograms stay unavailable; no inferred zeros or router percentiles.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "victoriametrics"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 21,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 10
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 3,
          "noValue": "Unavailable"
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Spans/s"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "ops"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Error %"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "percent"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": "^p(50|95|99)$"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "s"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "sortBy": [
          {
            "displayName": "Spans/s",
            "desc": true
          }
        ]
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "expr": "sum by (service_name) (rate(llm_span_calls[5m]))"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "expr": "100 * sum by (service_name) (rate(llm_span_errors[5m])) / (sum by (service_name) (rate(llm_span_calls[5m])) > 0)"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (service_name, le) (rate(llm_span_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])))"
        },
        {
          "refId": "D",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (service_name, le) (rate(llm_span_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])))"
        },
        {
          "refId": "E",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (service_name, le) (rate(llm_span_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])))"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "merge",
          "options": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true
            },
            "indexByName": {
              "service_name": 0,
              "Value #A": 1,
              "Value #B": 2,
              "Value #C": 3,
              "Value #D": 4,
              "Value #E": 5
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "service_name": "Service",
              "Value #A": "Spans/s",
              "Value #B": "Error %",
              "Value #C": "p50",
              "Value #D": "p95",
              "Value #E": "p99"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Trace RED: per service and model",
      "description": "Only spans carrying a nonempty model label are included. General service spans remain in the service table. Error and histogram semantics match that table, including the live check needed for llm_span_duration_seconds_bucket naming. Missing series stay unavailable.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "victoriametrics"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 21,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 10
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 3,
          "noValue": "Unavailable"
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Spans/s"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "ops"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Error %"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "percent"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": "^p(50|95|99)$"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "s"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "sortBy": [
          {
            "displayName": "Spans/s",
            "desc": true
          }
        ]
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "expr": "sum by (service_name, model) (rate(llm_span_calls{model!=\"\"}[5m]))"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "expr": "100 * sum by (service_name, model) (rate(llm_span_errors{model!=\"\"}[5m])) / (sum by (service_name, model) (rate(llm_span_calls{model!=\"\"}[5m])) > 0)"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (service_name, model, le) (rate(llm_span_duration_seconds_bucket{model!=\"\"}[5m])))"
        },
        {
          "refId": "D",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (service_name, model, le) (rate(llm_span_duration_seconds_bucket{model!=\"\"}[5m])))"
        },
        {
          "refId": "E",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (service_name, model, le) (rate(llm_span_duration_seconds_bucket{model!=\"\"}[5m])))"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "merge",
          "options": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true
            },
            "indexByName": {
              "service_name": 0,
              "Value #A": 2,
              "Value #B": 3,
              "Value #C": 4,
              "Value #D": 5,
              "Value #E": 6,
              "model": 1
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "service_name": "Service",
              "Value #A": "Spans/s",
              "Value #B": "Error %",
              "Value #C": "p50",
              "Value #D": "p95",
              "Value #E": "p99",
              "model": "Model"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
